// Finite 1D DGP prior sampling, ported from dgpsi.synthetic.path.generate.
// Each layer has one GP node. The exact package conventions are retained:
// sexp=exp(-d^2), Matern-5/2, and covariance=scale*(K+nugget*I).
// Source: https://github.com/mingdeyu/DGP/blob/master/dgpsi/synthetic.py
